  "description": "Strongly-typed Avalonia theming. Decorate a class with [Theme], install this package, and the bundled Roslyn source generator emits one {theme:PropertyName} markup extension per public property — your XAML binds theme values directly with full IntelliSense and no runtime code generation. Includes AngelSix.ThemeEngine.SourceGen as an analyzer; a single install gives you both the runtime and the generator.",
